Z||000008||DaRkLoRD||07-20-2000||01:25 AM||||I used to watch Alf every afternoon when I was about 9!<BR>I also used to watch Darkwing Duck, Goof Troop, Duck Tales.. ahh.. those were the days.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>anyway, last summer my sister bought me a 2 foot tall Alf toy at a garage sale.. it's in mint condition, and I have it sitting on a shelf.. it has a top-hat on.. (I got that from my sister too) it looks like the "cat in the hat" one, except it's red green and yellow.. she won it at Canada's Wonderland, and gave it to me..   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>(my sister is cool!!)<P>------------------<BR>  <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A>  <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A><p>[This message has been edited by DaRkLoRD (edited 07-20-2000).]||||reg||10
